                                   "title":  "Wikipedia: The Inugami Curse",
                                   "snippet":  "[Wikipedia Synopsis] The Inugami Curse is a 1951 Japanese mystery novel by Seishi Yokomizo. It is part of the Kosuke Kindaichi series, which began with the 1946 novel, The Honjin Murders. The Inugami Curse was first published in English as The Inugami Clan by ICG Muse in 2003; this same translation was used for Stone Bridge Press\u0027s 2007 edition and Pushkin Vertigo\u0027s 2020 edition.",
                                   "link":  "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The%20Inugami%20Curse"
                               }
